<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\時計\時計.lcm" "SCRAP" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シナリオ\000過去へ馳せる夢\時計11回.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The sound of a clock announcing midnight could be heard inside a dream.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, wake up. If you're going to sleep, shall we go to your room?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I heard <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s voice, and my shoulder was shaken.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\過去へ馳せる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? I fell asleep...? Damn... and it was almost at a good scene..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been watching the DVD I saw together with <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> a month ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That time, all I thought about was how to save <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, and I could not watch it properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, I had <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> keep me company and watch it over again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"This won't do... From day one of a new life, lazing about like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, there's only the two of us, after all..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Just us, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Yeah, that's right... There's no one who used to wake me up when I overslept, and the one who looked after me isn't here anymore either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> always used to wake me up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From now on the two of us, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I, have to manage every last thing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, do you remember? That I'm a real witch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was true that <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> had said something like that, in this room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, don't think about that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth is, there is a memory I have kept asleep in the depths of my memory.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> fell from the tree, the trajectory of his fall shifted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If not for that, he would not have been impaled on the fence, and he would not have died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> must have been calling <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> a witch because of that.<PG>
But if he had fallen straight down like that, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> would have been pinned under <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> twisted his body with everything he had and shielded <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Too nice for his own good. That's <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> for you.<PG>
But, I can't tell <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> that. Because if I did, her guilt toward <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> would only grow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This, I keep in my own heart and nowhere else.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that was an accident. I know exactly how it feels to convince yourself an accident was a curse or something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But, that was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> went on talking.<PG>
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But, I've been thinking about it a lot lately. If only those two had had a little more courage... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If they'd had a little more courage and stopped themselves, today would have been a completely different May 6, I think."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... but, there's no harm in dreaming about it, is there? Just what it would be like if there were a life like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> turned a smile toward me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well then, goodnight, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And then <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> went back to her own room.<PG>
If only <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents had had more courage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> had not become a shinigami. [TN: shinigami: a god of death]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only I had had the courage to stand up to the bullying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even just one of those...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How would things have turned out then?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Long ago, when I became a witch, what was it that happened...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
